  "title": "Hedge fund CEO Gives $3bn to Carnegie Mellon University",
  "summary": "Hedge fund CEO Ken Griffin has announced a $3bn donation to Carnegie Mellon University, marking the largest single donation in the history of US education. The university will use the funds to build a new Miami campus and expand its research programs, while the billionaire investor is also investing in other university-related projects.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Ken Griffin, the founder and CEO of Citadel, made a $3bn donation to Carnegie Mellon University.",
      "confidence": 0.95
